		],
		"content": {
			"start": 7,
			"end": 554,
			"styles": "\n\t/* a hex escape that decodes to a backslash, at each name site */\n\t#a\\5c b {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n\t.a\\5c b {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n\ta\\5c b {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n\t:a\\5c b {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n\t::a\\5c b {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n\t[a\\5c b] {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n\ta\\5c b|c {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n\t/* every hex spelling of the backslash: uppercase, zero-padded, and a terminator\n\t   before the block */\n\t.a\\5C b,\n\t.a\\00005c b,\n\t.a\\5c {\n\t\tcolor: blue;\n\t}\n\t/* contrast: an identity-escaped backslash, and a hex escape of another character */\n\t.a\\\\b,\n\t.a\\41 b {\n\t\tcolor: green;\n\t}\n",
			"comment": null
		}
